          "insert": "Decision",
          "attributes": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " — Trigger and guardian process actors are not agents; they live with the phase that owns the workflow action, not in the catalog. "
        },
        {
          "insert": "Why",
          "attributes": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " — rejected cataloging them as roles; they are deterministic orchestration, not prompted work. "
        },
        {
          "insert": "Applies to",
